97
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:16,640
Oh yeah.

98
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:48,640
So I downloaded an app, could dream channel, and that one was developed by ish and I had just finished university studying a bachelor of visual arts where I also I like majored in photography and minored in digital art so I was like very into design and creativity so when I like looked at the app I saw a few things that could use improving and like I felt really excited about putting together this document with arrows where I wrote.

99
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:54,720
like this needs some improvements here and like this font needs to be consistent here.

