00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:49,440
Well, the process of creating it was quite a long one that it took about three years actually and wow.

131
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,160
It involved a lot of trial and error.

132
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:56,000
Like we designed the app completely different at the start.

133
00:12:56,320 --> 00:13:00,720
Like the first name that it had was modular before it became capsicum.

134
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:06,320
And we called it modular because we had like all these different modules, these rectangles.

135
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:16,000
Like the idea was actually-do module and a notes module.

136
00:13:16,560 --> 00:13:16,640
Yeah.

