Now we're calling them capsicum components.

143
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:35,360
Ooh.

144
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:36,000
Yeah.

145
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:40,400
So at the moment, they are default things.

146
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:48,480
Like there's not heaps of customization around your page, but we decided on that because during.

147
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:54,880
During our testing, we realized that we don't really want to build our page every single day for our planner.

148
00:13:55,200 --> 00:14:00,800
Like we want to be able to set it up once and then be able to use it every day.

149
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:06,000
So we have a bunch of defaults and you can customize that a bit.

150
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:12,080
Like you can change your you can change your color and like what tape style that you want.

151
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:25,600
The tape we use tape to like as a divider but in physical planners a lot of people use washi tape on their page like to divide up sections and to decorate it.

