00:48:11,120 --> 00:48:19,680
And so I always just end up tweeting it out and then letting everyone send me all their corrections because it's it's embarrassing, but I I just know I'm bad at it.

464
00:48:19,760 --> 00:48:21,760
And I was like, Oh man, it would be nice to have another person.

465
00:48:21,920 --> 00:48:29,600
But the flip side of that is you have to have agreements on like what your one voice as an app is going to be.

