00:48:34,800 --> 00:49:23,760
Especially since you have two apps with two different people kind of yeah there's probably a different slightly different voice for capsicum than there is for when did I yeah so for when did I sometimes I do just like tweet out a message on my own and I am wanting to continue to learn development as well so that I can I want to like step up more on the project but and like at times I have had permission with capsicum as well to like be in charge of doing a tweet but usually I still like being able to share it and I will say that what you do with getting the community involved, like how does my app store description sound or how does this, how does this piece of writing sound for like doing a tweet on it?

