00:49:57,200 --> 00:50:11,040
And then people are very, very, very open to, like, giving, I won't even call it like criticism, but it's more just like thoughts or, oh, maybe you don't want to do that because XYZ or, oh, you probably haven't seen this yet.

473
00:50:11,200 --> 00:50:12,320
People are so, like, kind.

