00:51:15,760 --> 00:51:21,280
And then I was getting frustrated about something and I tweeted, you know, a thing out saying I couldn't figure it out.

486
00:51:21,520 --> 00:51:24,480
And I think it was, I think it was Kyle actually may have been that first person.

