00:53:04,240 --> 00:53:11,520
And you were talking to me and giving me like positive feedback, and not even like pointers and tips, but just like, I think what you're doing is really cool here.

493
00:53:11,680 --> 00:53:13,760
I think you're on to something good with this idea or something.

494
00:53:14,080 --> 00:53:23,040
