00:53:23,360 --> 00:53:24,560
You know, is this really worth it?

496
00:53:25,040 --> 00:53:34,480
I wasn't expecting to make any money, but then hearing someone in the community who you sort of respected the work they did just say something nice to you is it's really like powerful thing.

