00:53:35,040 --> 00:54:00,720
And so because of that experience, I've been trying to do similar things with people and pretty much anyone who reaches out to me at this point, I'm very willing to talk to them about whatever they want to talk about with development or marketing or anything like that because one, I just find it fun to talk about anyway, but two, it's like so many people invested in me, not knowing anything about me or having any reason to whenever I was just starting out.

