I will say that I found it extremely hard for myself to do, but like I was quite motivated to try and achieve it and spend time with it even if it was hard and like I feel like people have a stereotype sometimes that women can't be developers and like that it's more suited to men and I really don't I don't want to like contribute to that stereotype in any way like when I'm like struggling with it or anything, but people really came alongside me and like supported me and like offered help to me if I had any questions and I have taken a break from it for a while because I have a lot of other work and projects to do at the moment but I want to get back to it as soon as I can.

